          "quote": "观察有无尿痛、发烧、腰痛、浮肿或尿量明显减少"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Partial red-flag screening was done, but hyperkalemia-specific and chest/palpitation questions were omitted. The family was not asked to check for these, and no escalation threshold was explicitly given for them.",
