          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor only said 'please do not stop or adjust any anti-rejection drugs or insulin on your own' and did not specifically name tacrolimus, mycophenolate mofetil, or insulin, nor did the doctor ask the family to physically verify pill boxes or warn about self-stopping.",
          "quote": "请务必不要自行停用或调整任何抗排异药和胰岛素"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not explicitly name tacrolimus/mycophenolate mofetil, did not instruct the family to physically verify medication boxes, and did not state that self-stopping immunosuppression could threaten graft safety. This is a serious omission.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
