          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor recommends ED evaluation and urine/blood tests but does not specify renal function/potassium as key tests or name transplant follow-up/nephrology as the receiving channel.",
          "quote": "前往医院急诊科或肾内科/泌尿外科门诊就诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The testing and escalation plan is partially given, but the specific receiving channel (transplant follow-up/nephrology) and ED criteria (clots, bright-red urine, reduced urine output, etc.) are not explicitly stated.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
